 "proof_obligation": "bridge",
 "diagnosis": "The loop invariant only tracks that 0 <= n <= V.Length, but does not relate the accumulator x to the array elements. At loop exit (n == 0), Dafny cannot prove x == suma_vector(V, 0) because it has no information about how x was built up. The missing invariant x == suma_vector(V, n) captures that x always equals the sum of elements V[n..V.Length), which at entry is 0 (base case), is maintained by the recurrence suma_vector(V, n-1) = V[n-1] + suma_vector(V, n), and at exit (n==0) directly yields the postcondition."}

